  unitName: Dark Totem
  unitId: 60123
  unitNumber: 194
  description: A form created by the gods that embodies the strength of dark. It's
    huge, has powerful magic, and is very hard to control, so much so that even the
    gods who tried were forced to seal it away again. Its appearance engulfs the
    world in darkness, at which time the creatures of the dark begin to invade. Legend
    tells of those who bathe in its magic hoping to gain the power to fight the gods.
  summonDesc: I am a Dark Totem.<br>You would be wise to use my<br>godly powers responsibly.
